step Gaea Seeds
  tip The Gaea Seeds lie in the grass around the southern shore of Mirkfallon Lake, north of Sun Rock.
  tip Careful: Pridewings around the lake can aggro as a linked group.
  collect 16205 quest 6301

step Mirkweed
  when onquest 97538
  tip The Mirkweed grows on the bottom of Mirkfallon Lake, off the same southern shore: dive to the plants and the Dried Mirkweed Piles; both give pods. Watch your breath.
  collect 278201 x30 quest 97538 @48.5,40.2

